{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_mint_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_mint_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "昔日重現",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mint_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2e664c13d98a9203c05922012f1683213299f87dd9c618e55ef78580cfd53681",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_towerinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（米蘭達......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（教授還有大家，每個人都有寄信來，大家都寫得好長啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（一、二、三......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（還有好幾頁沒看完。呃，怎麼還有人把自己的戀愛日記也寄過來了啊！唔哇......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還在磨蹭什麼？要出發了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我馬上就來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（沒辦法，之後再看好了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（大家都在擔心我，但是現在還沒有辦法回去見大家。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......我要更努力才行！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薄綠小姐，下午好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天火學姐！還有桑葚，下午好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太慢了！怎麼這麼磨磨蹭蹭的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，還沒有到出發的時間啊......天火學姐怎麼看起來一副不耐煩的樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是因為我一直在詢問天火小姐一些關於維多利亞大學的問題......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，桑葚對大學的事情感興趣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是的，我聽說維多利亞有很厲害的大學，普羅旺斯姐就推薦我來找天火小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，普羅旺斯那傢伙還真會給我找麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，別看這傢伙一臉傻樣，她也算是著名教授的得意門生，有什麼問題就問她好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊嗚天活薛姐噗要恰沃的臉啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好疼......反對暴力！禁止暴力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，兩位看起來關係真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這叫作指導，不是暴力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，不鬧了。這次的任務是探測這片山區的地層活動，根據從附近村落收集來的情報，這一帶最近時常有地震發生，危險程度很高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "防護設備都裝備好了？好了的話我們就繼續向內側深入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是的！我準備好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也沒問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望能採集到好的樣本數據......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我警告你，這次可不是什麼輕鬆的任務。你要是再走丟，我可不會去找你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會不會，怎麼會呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，大概不會......吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你最好是不會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，學姐！等等我啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_caveentrance"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這一帶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從這個洞穴深入的話，應該可以到達我們的目標觀測地點。嗯，和之前測算的結果一致！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，這些都是算出來的嗎？果然專業人士就是很厲害啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我這點本事不算什麼啦！桑葚你見過艾雅法拉小姐嗎？那位才是專家呢！還有地靈前輩也是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，還有天火學姐！雖然現在是在源石技藝方面更有名，但學姐當年可是跳級拿了多學位的天才哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客套話就免了。這附近的樣本採集好了？好了的話就去下一個點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說到這個......我剛剛同時用儀器分析了一下採集到的樣本，天火學姐，你看這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然只是初步解析，但能看得出深層的源石活性反應很強烈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深層的源石活性反應......根據我的經驗，一般這樣的地帶都會出現大大小小的災害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如說......地震。而且，這一帶的岩層似乎都很疏鬆，和之前那次也很像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？沒、沒什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些都還只是推論，具體分析的話，我還需要更多的數據才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你啊......應該沒忘記這次我們是為什麼來的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我當然知道啦！這都是為了完成探測任務收集的數據嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧，天火學姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......信你一次。那就繼續深入吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學姐，這邊的數值也比正常值要高出很多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，意料之中......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的結構很穩定，必要的時候可以充當避難所！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "光線和空氣都變差了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小心！前面有感染生物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，不過如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天火小姐！下次請不要在這種地方一言不合就使用法術了！這很危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈，學姐還是那麼直接......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！你們看，那邊那個是不是上次博士提過的礦石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你別亂跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡開始不穩定了，我們速戰速決！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛震動的時候監測到的數值......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薄綠小姐......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？啊，我沒事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡很難走......兩位請小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天火小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薄綠——那傢伙呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會有錯的，這個數值！和上次、和上次出意外的時候一樣......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果能拿到核心數據的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......天火學姐？桑葚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走散了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗚......是從上面落下來的碎石？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不要緊，不要緊的，只是有一點痛而已，我還有防護裝備！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（比起......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭達",
