      "text": "我是不清楚薄綠小姐過去到底發生了什麼，我只知道，現在我們是一個小隊！薄綠小姐你不僅代表你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你的研究有多重要......薄綠小姐！請你更加珍惜你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不懂研究......但是，天火小姐擁有這方面的知識，可以幫得上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我很清楚該如何應對地震後的危險，怎樣才能夠最大限度地保障兩位的安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果這還不夠，羅德島還有更多值得信賴的前輩......為什麼一定要自己一個人扛著呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，這是我該做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管身在何處，不管有怎樣的危險，我都會繼續這份研究！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“為探尋真理，我甘願冒任何風險”......在加入教授的研究室時，我就已經發過誓了！所以我必須要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對！不是這樣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以理解這是薄綠小姐作為研究者，對真相的探求，但這絕不是——絕對不是薄綠小姐必須承擔的義務！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這一點上，桑葚說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薄綠，教授還有其他人，應該有給你寫信吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教授的......信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，信。你今天應該帶來了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道那些信裡沒有提到過嗎？他們可是因為不放心，連我這邊都聯繫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米蘭達、米蘭達醒過來了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的有！真的有米蘭達的信！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......太、太好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼在這裡哭出來啊，真丟人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼樣？就算這樣，你還堅持要自己身涉險境嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我一直覺得，嗚哇......是我、是我不好，弄丟了米蘭達拼死拿到的樣本......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我必須要......必須要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺是一個很複雜的故事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論如何，薄綠小姐，不要再像這次一樣不將自己的安危放在心上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不可以再像這次一樣胡來了！如果有需要，我們......羅德島的大家都願意幫忙，一定有辦法的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚......哇啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起！對不起！我又讓大家擔心了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那下次還可以繼續深入收集地質數據嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "桑葚",
      "speakerId": "avg_473_mberry_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只、只要措施得當，不隨意行動的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，別被她騙了，我看她根本沒在反省吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“感謝您一直以來的照顧，我會在羅德島照顧好自己，並且繼續研究......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......好，就這麼寫吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在這裡啊，我找你半天了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天火學姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學姐怎麼來了？是有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前不是說想要參考文獻嗎？我去找了點你這個課題方向的論文，還有幾篇內容雖然無關，但研究手法我覺得可以參考。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，都在這了，你自己挑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學姐......難道說，是為了我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打住！只是查點資料順帶看了看而已，你別......哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "學姐！你聽我說......我做出地質層的深層分析了！嗚嗚嗚！！艾雅法拉小姐也誇獎我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？讓我看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是做得很不錯嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "天火",
      "speakerId": "avg_166_skfire_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你應該不會是又為了數據而冒險了吧？嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有啦！我有好好申請了任務，和其他幹員們一起行動的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經想明白了！天火學姐，不論如何，我都會繼續做我想做的研究！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還有很多很多好奇的事，很多很多想要搞明白的現象......不管結果如何我都不會半途而廢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我也不想讓大家擔心，我不會再那樣頭腦發熱啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，過一段時間我還要去看望一個朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薄綠",
      "speakerId": "avg_388_mint_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果到時候太沒精神或是受了傷，可不好意思去看她呀！"
